t":"Opengrep Finding: AIK_backticks-use"}},{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"warning"},"fullDescription":{"text":"The binary integrity check is missing in the Dockerfile. It is recommended to include integrity checks to ensure the authenticity and integrity of downloaded binaries.\n"},"help":{"markdown":"The binary integrity check is missing in the Dockerfile. It is recommended to include integrity checks to ensure the authenticity and integrity of downloaded binaries.\n","text":"The binary integrity check is missing in the Dockerfile. It is recommended to include integrity checks to ensure the authenticity and integrity of downloaded binaries.\n"},"id":"AIK_binary_integrity_check_missing","name":"AIK_binary_integrity_check_missing","properties":{"precision":"very-high","tags":[]},"shortDescription":{"text":"Opengrep Finding: AIK_binary_integrity_check_missing"}},{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"The `strcat` and family of functions do not guarantee the final string to be null terminated.\nConsider using one of the following alternatives: `StringCbCat`, `StringCbCatEx`,\n`StringCbCatN`, `StringCbCatNEx`, `StringCchCat`, `StringCchCatEx`, `StringCchCatN`, or\n`StringCchCatNEx` or `snprintf`.\n\nFor more information please see: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/api/strsafe/\n"},"help":{"markdown":"The `strcat` and family of functions do not guarantee the final string to be null terminated.\nConsider using one of the following alternatives: `StringCbCat`, `StringCbCatEx`,\n`StringCbCatN`, `StringCbCatNEx`, `StringCchCat`, `StringCchCatEx`, `StringCchCatN`, or\n`StringCchCatNEx` or `snprintf`.\n\nFor more information please see: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/api/strsafe/\n","text":"The `strcat` and family of functions do not guarantee the final string to be null terminated.\nConsider using one of the following alternatives: `StringCbCat`, `StringCbCatEx`,\n`StringCbCatN`, `StringCbCatNEx`, `StringCchCat`, `StringCchCatEx`, `StringCchCatN`, or\n`StringCchCatNEx` or `snprintf`.\n\nFor more information please see: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/api/strsafe/\n"},"id":"AIK_c_StrCat","name":"AIK_c_StrCat","properties":{"precision":"very-high","tags":[]},"shortDescription":{"text":"Opengrep Finding: AIK_c_StrCat"}},{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"strcpy found"},"help":{"markdown":"strcpy found","text":"strcpy found"},"id":"AIK_c_Strcpy","name":"AIK_c_Strcpy","properties":{"precision":"very-high","tags":[]},"shortDescription":{"text":"Opengrep Finding: AIK_c_Strcpy"}},{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"Unsafe use of EVP_des_* functions"},"help":{"markdown":"Unsafe use of EVP_des_* functions","text":"Unsafe use of EVP_des_* functions"},"id":"AIK_c_crypto_EVP_des_ecb_EVP_des_cbc","name":"AIK_c_crypto_EVP_des_ecb_EVP_des_cbc","properties":{"precision":"very-high","tags":[]},"shortDescription":{"text":"Opengrep Finding: AIK_c_crypto_EVP_des_ecb_EVP_des_cbc"}},{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"Unsafe use of EVP_rc4_40 or EVP_rc2_40_cbc functions"},"help":{"markdown":"Unsafe use of EVP_rc4_40 or EVP_rc2_40_cbc functions","text":"Unsafe use of EVP_rc4_40 or EVP_rc2_40_cbc functions"},"id":"AIK_c_crypto_EVP_rc4_40_EVP_rc2_40_cbc","name":"AIK_c_crypto_EVP_rc4_40_EVP_rc2_40_cbc","properties":{"precision":"very-high","tags":[]},"shortDescription":{"text":"Opengrep Finding: AIK_c_crypto_EVP_rc4_40_EVP_rc2_40_cbc"}},{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"Unsafe use of crypt.h functions"},"help":{"markdown":"Unsafe use of crypt.h functions","text":"Unsafe use of crypt.h functions"},"id":"AIK_c_crypto_crypt_crypt_r","name":"AIK_c_crypto_crypt_crypt_r","properties":{"precision":"very-high","tags":[]},"shortDescription":{"text":"Opengrep Finding: AIK_c_crypto_crypt_crypt_r"}},{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"Potential format string vulnerability in syslog call"},"help":{"markdown":"Potential format string vulnerability in syslog call","text":"Potential format string vulnerability in syslog call"},"id":"AIK_c_format_syslog","name":"AIK_c_format_syslog","properties":{"precision":"very-high","tags":[]},"shortDescription":{"text":"Opengrep Finding: AIK_c_format_syslog"}},{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"The atoi family of functions can overflow or underflow and do not report conversion\nerrors. Prefer strtol/strtoul (or equivalents) and check for errors.\n"},"help":{"markdown":"The atoi family of functions can overflow or underflow and do not report conversion\nerrors. Prefer strtol/strtoul (or equivalents) and check for errors.\n","text":"The atoi family of functions can overflow or underflow and do not report conversion\nerrors. Prefer strtol/strtoul (or equivalents) and check for errors.\n"},"id":"AIK_c_integer_atoi_atol","name":"AIK_c_integer_atoi_atol","properties":{"precision":"very-high","tags":[]},"shortDescription":{"text":"Opengrep Finding: AIK_c_integer_atoi_atol"}},{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"Usage of deprecated function (getlogin)"},"help":{"markdown":"Usage of deprecated function (getlogin)","text":"Usage of deprecated function (getlogin)"},"id":"AIK_c_misc_getlogin","name":"AIK_c_misc_getlogin","properties":{"precision":"very-high","tags":[]},"shortDescription":{"text":"Opengrep Finding: AIK_c_misc_getlogin"}},{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"warning"},"fullDescription":{"text":"Usage of insufficient random number generators"},"help":{"markdown":"Usage of insufficient random number generators","text":"Usage of insufficient random number generators"},"id":"AIK_c_random_drand48_erand48","name":"AIK_c_random_drand48_erand48","properties":{"precision":"very-high","tags":[]},"shortDescription":{"text":"Opengrep Finding: AIK_c_random_drand48_erand48"}},{"defaultConfiguration":{"level