 $FUNCS with payload $DATA"},"id":"AIK_php-ssrf","name":"AIK_php-ssrf","properties":{"precision":"very-high","tags":[]},"shortDescription":{"text":"Opengrep Finding: AIK_php-ssrf"}},{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"The application uses AuraSql functions with potentially user input in the query, which could lead to a SQL injection."},"help":{"markdown":"The application uses AuraSql functions with potentially user input in the query, which could lead to a SQL injection.","text":"The application uses AuraSql functions with potentially user input in the query, which could lead to a SQL injection."},"id":"AIK_php_aura_sql_sqli","name":"AIK_php_aura_sql_sqli","properties":{"precision":"very-high","tags":[]},"shortDescription":{"text":"Opengrep Finding: AIK_php_aura_sql_sqli"}},{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"A noSQL statement is being concatenated with a potentially user-controllable string, which could lead to a noSQL injection vulnerability."},"help":{"markdown":"A noSQL statement is being concatenated with a potentially user-controllable string, which could lead to a noSQL injection vulnerability.","text":"A noSQL statement is being concatenated with a potentially user-controllable string, which could lead to a noSQL injection vulnerability."},"id":"AIK_php_no-sql-injection","name":"AIK_php_no-sql-injection","properties":{"precision":"very-high","tags":[]},"shortDescription":{"text":"Opengrep Finding: AIK_php_no-sql-injection"}},{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"Detected use of unsigned jwt token"},"help":{"markdown":"Detected use of unsigned jwt token","text":"Detected use of unsigned jwt token"},"id":"AIK_php_unsigned_jwt","name":"AIK_php_unsigned_jwt","properties":{"precision":"very-high","tags":[]},"shortDescription":{"text":"Opengrep Finding: AIK_php_unsigned_jwt"}},{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"The 'phpinfo' function may reveal sensitive information about your environment."},"help":{"markdown":"The 'phpinfo' function may reveal sensitive information about your environment.","text":"The 'phpinfo' function may reveal sensitive information about your environment."},"id":"AIK_phpinfo-use","name":"AIK_phpinfo-use","properties":{"precision":"very-high","tags":[]},"shortDescription":{"text":"Opengrep Finding: AIK_phpinfo-use"}},{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"Possible LFI"},"help":{"markdown":"Possible LFI","text":"Possible LFI"},"id":"AIK_py_LFI","name":"AIK_py_LFI","properties":{"precision":"very-high","tags":[]},"shortDescription":{"text":"Opengrep Finding: AIK_py_LFI"}},{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"Should not disable ssl by default"},"help":{"markdown":"Should not disable ssl by default","text":"Should not disable ssl by default"},"id":"AIK_python-insecure-ssl-disabled","name":"AIK_python-insecure-ssl-disabled","properties":{"precision":"very-high","tags":[]},"shortDescription":{"text":"Opengrep Finding: AIK_python-insecure-ssl-disabled"}},{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"When running Python in production in optimized mode, assert calls are not executed. This mode is enabled by setting the PYTHONOPTIMIZE command line flag. Optimized mode is usually ON in production. Any safety check done using assert will not be executed."},"help":{"markdown":"When running Python in production in optimized mode, assert calls are not executed. This mode is enabled by setting the PYTHONOPTIMIZE command line flag. Optimized mode is usually ON in production. Any safety check done using assert will not be executed.","text":"When running Python in production in optimized mode, assert calls are not executed. This mode is enabled by setting the PYTHONOPTIMIZE command line flag. Optimized mode is usually ON in production. Any safety check done using assert will not be executed."},"id":"AIK_python_B101","name":"AIK_python_B101","properties":{"precision":"very-high","tags":[]},"shortDescription":{"text":"Opengrep Finding: AIK_python_B101"}},{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"Unsafe exec usage can lead to remote code execution."},"help":{"markdown":"Unsafe exec usage can lead to remote code execution.","text":"Unsafe exec usage can lead to remote code execution."},"id":"AIK_python_B102","name":"AIK_python_B102","properties":{"precision":"very-high","tags":[]},"shortDescription":{"text":"Opengrep Finding: AIK_python_B102"}},{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"Running Flask applications in debug mode results in the Werkzeug debugger being enabled. This includes a feature that allows arbitrary code execution. Documentation for both Flask and Werkzeug strongly suggests that debug mode should never be enabled on production systems."},"help":{"markdown":"Running Flask applications in debug mode results in the Werkzeug debugger being enabled. This includes a feature that allows arbitrary code execution. Documentation for both Flask and Werkzeug strongly suggests that debug mode should never be enabled on production systems.","text":"Running Flask applications in debug mode results in the Werkzeug debugger being enabled. This includes a feature that allows arbitrary code execution. Documentation for both Flask and Werkzeug strongly suggests that debug mode should never be enabled on production systems."},"id":"AIK_python_B201","name":"AIK_python_B201","properties":{"precision":"very-high","tags":[]},"shortDescription":{"text":"Opengrep Finding: AIK_python_B201"}},{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"Unlike JSON, it is possible to construct malicious Pickle data which can execute attacker-controller code during loading of data (unpickling)."},"help":{"markdown":"Unlike JSON, it is possible to construct malicious Pickle data which can execute attacker-controller code during