xt":"Opengrep Finding: AIK_python_B307"}},{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"Using urllib_urlopen to open remote URLs is dangerous if the input URL is not checked. This function allows urls in the form of file: which could result in opening local files instead of remote files. Other custom schemes are possible as well."},"help":{"markdown":"Using urllib_urlopen to open remote URLs is dangerous if the input URL is not checked. This function allows urls in the form of file: which could result in opening local files instead of remote files. Other custom schemes are possible as well.","text":"Using urllib_urlopen to open remote URLs is dangerous if the input URL is not checked. This function allows urls in the form of file: which could result in opening local files instead of remote files. Other custom schemes are possible as well."},"id":"AIK_python_B310","name":"AIK_python_B310","properties":{"precision":"very-high","tags":[]},"shortDescription":{"text":"Opengrep Finding: AIK_python_B310"}},{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"Using various XLM methods to parse untrusted XML data is known to be vulnerable to XML attacks. Methods should be replaced with their defusedxml equivalents."},"help":{"markdown":"Using various XLM methods to parse untrusted XML data is known to be vulnerable to XML attacks. Methods should be replaced with their defusedxml equivalents.","text":"Using various XLM methods to parse untrusted XML data is known to be vulnerable to XML attacks. Methods should be replaced with their defusedxml equivalents."},"id":"AIK_python_B314","name":"AIK_python_B314","properties":{"precision":"very-high","tags":[]},"shortDescription":{"text":"Opengrep Finding: AIK_python_B314"}},{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"Using various XLM methods to parse untrusted XML data is known to be vulnerable to XML attacks. Methods should be replaced with their defusedxml equivalent